<section id="features" class="marketing-section content-section" aria-labelledby="features-title">
  <div class="features-heading">
    <h2 id="features-title" tabindex="-1">Choose what stays in sight.</h2>
  </div>
  <figure class="statusline-figure">
    <div class="statusline" aria-label="Sample cxstatusline with model, thinking effort, context, Git branch, and Git changes">
      <span class="signal signal-model"><span>Model</span>: Codex</span>
      <span class="signal signal-thinking"><span>Thinking</span>: high</span>
      <span class="signal signal-context"><span>Context</span>: 50k/200k (25%)</span>
      <span class="signal signal-branch">git main</span>
      <span class="signal signal-changes">+42,-10</span>
    </div>
    <div class="annotations" aria-label="What each statusline signal shows">
      <article class="annotation annotation-session"><span class="connector"></span><h3>Know your session</h3><p>See the model and session at a glance.</p></article>
      <article class="annotation annotation-context"><span class="connector"></span><h3>Watch your context</h3><p>Keep an eye on context usage as you work.</p></article>
      <article class="annotation annotation-git"><span class="connector"></span><h3>Keep Git close</h3><p>See your branch and changes, right here.</p></article>
    </div>
  </figure>
  <div class="feature-columns">
    <article>
      <h3>One to three rows.</h3>
      <p>Reorder widgets. Choose colors. Add Powerline separators.</p>
      <div class="row-samples" aria-label="Three illustrative statusline rows"><div class="sample-row row-one">Model: Codex <i>|</i> Thinking: high <i>|</i> Context: 50k/200k (25%)</div><div class="sample-row row-two">git main <i>|</i> +42,-10</div><div class="sample-row row-three">Session: &lt;1m <i>|</i> Weekly: 12.0% <i>|</i> Weekly Reset: 1d 12hr 30m</div></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>Your own signals.</h3>
      <p>Extend the native app with your own commands.</p>
      <div class="custom-sample">Custom text · Symbols · Commands</div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
